cAESJge77McQ7kNvwHXl5KC&_nc_oc=AdoM4uM9I8PvxD1RA9nsUbHe5B2dr7yH10p72AR5EMyb0FSqvaFGpOpVk9il9F6ElSM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKxXayBriTFvVtD1gIhHGYQY5JywJBZQPRmV5B0eGHodA&oe=6AA6AFB7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fFvhQ3DIGO0Q7kNvwGubNLV&_nc_oc=AdrBZA1QT_Qzt0zwJpQqSKlIyChKASvFgrtfHEEGCUbdqc_ulFKqLNQfv5xtgfrZDo0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJEmXAxJEGf3Aa4hBzxlFUQdURRsZ8ukaEZDl-1Dg8DHA&oe=6AA6B14A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fJRRxBBXlNYQ7kNvwEVu84S&_nc_oc=AdpcFKGZSWE4TloDMBxhoujLY1dCHpRuuvVrrFbUIiXJ-qy8WNVqOAfLIvh79X1aNSs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJvLNxEOmyN9ePIQS6ZSKpu8S9ug_JKd8ba5EuF0Vvcng&oe=6AA69E6F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=si4JFC2yjRYQ7kNvwH__M9A&_nc_oc=AdqqrQ37fBLoVhQM-xFNRHZecdZtTuNMxM8z63DrSVfax_qJmVzJtVQGOfRChAYJ08U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJwGvm8ToHI06Ce_F87weboW4UJyrE9reyCFqushD5sdg&oe=6AA6C003"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tOhI2lJW3J4Q7kNvwHcElNd&_nc_oc=AdpT8z20oPHT4dX8mFqxxYPc_HTJ8Qzf0BwHP7dMyJMdPqh1x3-Z4tJRNrI64ZjOEXs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIrUnNhmzRGPmyWfvomhq-pvIy53ITwy5T96egD2HPyGA&oe=6AA6B858"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5HjFwUQZPiwQ7kNvwGEq5sT&_nc_oc=Adrnxi2XxBFLjjStzFh-NHM6-YFRHGaeUqEUtl3x55NmSmzFNr8bkWf0G4TDtGX6Mrg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLHOvBZo1Y6Ym9z8yeaxtJzEjtmJeC63XR34cBF9EciKg&oe=6AA6933C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080